            "author_association": "NONE",
            "body": "Ah thanks for pointing me to all that information! I tried the pattern `',%s*'`, as I don't expect there to be a lot of spaces before the comma in any situation I can think of.\r\n\r\nI can see what you mean by the ambiguity, in my case putting the cursor on the comma or the space after the comma deletes the argument to the right, except in the case of the first argument, where it deletes to the left (the first argument). I much prefer that behavior to having to fix the whitespace manually though! I will get used to not placing the cursor on the comma or whitespace I imagine.\r\n\r\nAgain thank you! ",
